    "summary": "Wooden karetao puppet with moveable arms, naturalistic male face with full facial tattoo and cap dome over head; apparently female genitalia. Arms plain, each with six fingers and thumb, on twisted-flax string. Body: front, back and legs covered with rauponga with square pakati; flat, plain spirals incised on buttocks; pitau on back of head. Short shaft below feet.",
